<title>USA: ERLY shares rise on stock dividend news.</title>
<headline>ERLY shares rise on stock dividend news.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of ERLY Industries rose about 18 percent on Thursday after the company announced a ten percent stock dividend late Wednesday.</p>
<p>Erly shares added 1-35/128 to 8-1/4 and were one of the highest percent gainers on the Nasdaq. The company said it would issue a 10 percent stock dividend to holders of record as of September 23, with the distribution of shares to be made October 2, 1996.</p>
<p>Erly also said its American Rice subsidiary completed its sale of 39 acres of property in Houston for $13 million.</p>
